@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Counter Order

|Cashier|
start
:Open POS order screen;
:Select customer or walk-in mode;
:Add products and quantities;
:Choose delivery type;
if (Apply coupon?) then (Yes)
  :Enter coupon code;
  :Validate coupon;
endif

:Validate items and stock;
if (Valid order?) then (Yes)
  :Create order at counter;
  if (Payment now?) then (Yes)
    :Send payment request;
    :Process payment;
    :Return payment result;
  endif
  :Return order summary;
  :Show created order;
else (No)
  :Return error message;
  :Show validation error;
endif

if (Order update exception?) then (Yes)
  :Rollback and return error;
endif
stop
@enduml
